# ctrl+k (kill to end of line) then ctrl+y (yank it back), and the
# "Ctrl+Y to paste deleted text" hint that shows until the next keystroke
# (internal/tui/editor/model.go's EventKilled / justKilled,
# docs/claude-code-reference.md §2, mode-manual.txt row 8).
# The cursor is placed with plain right-arrows, not alt+f: Orca's synthetic
# Option keys lose their modifier under kiln's kitty keyboard protocol
# (qa/findings kitty-mode-drops-arrow-modifiers, wontfix).
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@smoke
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE keep this, drop this part
KEY ctrl+a
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
KEY right
SHOT before-kill
KEY ctrl+k
SHOT after-kill
EXPECT /keep this,/
EXPECT_NOT /drop this part/
EXPECT /Ctrl\+Y to paste deleted text/
KEY ctrl+y
SHOT after-yank
EXPECT /keep this, drop this part/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
